                "Concentrate stand KY-HIL on Kivcet-Yair flags a 48 pps charge-hole growl before "
                "the lance PT even publishes 1.8 bar (cap 2.4). Growl-first parks 22 t/h feed; "
                "lance-first would drop pellets into a noisy shaft. The hardware-in-loop rig, "
                "not the smelter floor, is the gate authority.",